## Human Review Checklist

  [ ] License acceptability confirmed (MIT/Apache-2.0 only — no source-available)
  [ ] Provenance citations complete (Source/Origin/Imported/Format/License)
  [ ] Docker gating acceptable for code-bearing skills
  [ ] Approve promotion → mark each group ACTIVE in its INDEX.sdd
      (change "Status: CANDIDATE" or registry "status" to ACTIVE)
  [ ] OR reject with reason → task created for removal/rework

## After Approval

  1. Update each group INDEX.sdd: Status: ACTIVE
  2. registry.json: source.status active (already) — no change needed
  3. Log decision in history.json (exec entry: promotion approved by human)
  4. Close task 2026-0906-005

